<title>UK: Banque Libano Francaise ups Euro CD to $125 mln.</title>
<headline>Banque Libano Francaise ups Euro CD to $125 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Libano Francaise S.A.L. has increased a five-year Euro deposit certificate issue to $125 million from $100 million, lead manager Indosuez Capital said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal will be priced later to yield between 225 and 245 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
